    [*] --> Draft : CreateCampaign / Marketer

    Draft --> PendingReview : SubmitCampaign / Marketer
    PendingReview --> Approved : ReviewCampaign(approve) / Reviewer
    PendingReview --> Rejected : ReviewCampaign(reject) / Reviewer
    PendingReview --> ChangesRequested : ReviewCampaign(requestChanges) / Reviewer
    PendingReview --> Draft : WithdrawSubmission / Marketer

    ChangesRequested --> PendingReview : ReviseCampaign / Marketer

    Approved --> Scheduled : ScheduleCampaign / Marketer
    Approved --> Draft : (material change, system-triggered)

    Rejected --> Draft : RestartCampaign / Marketer

    Scheduled --> [*] : terminal
